{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Return</b> — The prophet says: Return to Jerusalem, for it is a fortress, for there the Hashmoneans are." "<b>Also today I declare</b> — After 'declare,' this is a repetition." "<b>I will restore to you</b> — The sense is: like an emissary who comes to see what the declarer will declare."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:33.817130714Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}